# OpenSSH policy for the Moshi fallback connection.
#
# Tailscale SSH owns port 22 on the Tailscale interface and is used by Herdr.
# Moshi uses ordinary OpenSSH key authentication on port 2222 instead.
# Install this file as /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-moshi-herdr.conf on the host.

Port 2222
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
